sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer
    participant Node as NodoSensor (ID 2)
    participant Sensor as DHT/Soil
    participant Engine as ProtocolEngine
    participant Gateway

    %% --- Initialization ---
    Node->>Node: Setup (ID=2)
    Node->>Sensor: Init Sensors
    Node->>Engine: Register Gateway (MB:ID 1)
    
    %% --- Main Loop (Periodic) ---
    loop Every 5 Minutes
        Timer->>Node: Wake Up (Deep Sleep limit)
        activate Node
        
        Node->>Sensor: read()
        Sensor-->>Node: {Temp: 24.5, Hum: 60}
        
        Node->>Engine: sendTempHumReport(Target=1, T=24.5, H=60)
        Engine->>Gateway: ESP-NOW Frame (0x0B)
        
        note right of Gateway: Gateway forwards to Host
        
        Node->>Node: Check if other sensors need reading
        
        Node->>Node: Go to Deep Sleep
        deactivate Node
    end
